---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Support — NodalPulse"
  description="Reach the NodalPulse team for account, billing, and coverage questions."
>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Support</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">
          How to reach us and check service status.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-body">

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Before you write</h2>
          <p>
            Most questions about how NodalPulse works are answered in the Help Center:
          </p>
          <ul class="help-links">
            <li><a href="/help/getting-started/">Getting started</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/how-daily-briefs-work/">How daily briefs work</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/deadlines-confirmed-vs-estimated/">Deadlines: confirmed vs. estimated</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/ask-the-record/">Ask the Record</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/account-and-billing/">Account and billing</a></li>
            <li><a href="/help/faq/">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Email <a href="mailto:hello@nodalpulse.com">hello@nodalpulse.com</a> for account,
            billing, and coverage questions. We respond within one business day.
          </p>
          <p>
            When reporting a coverage gap or a brief error, include your account email,
            the docket number, the filing date, and what you expected to see.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Billing and subscriptions</h2>
          <p>
            Manage your subscription, update your payment method, or download invoices through the
            billing portal in your account settings. For billing disputes or refund requests, contact
            <a href="mailto:hello@nodalpulse.com">hello@nodalpulse.com</a> with your account email.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Service status</h2>
          <p>
            Check <a href="/status/">nodalpulse.com/status</a> for current service availability
            and incident history. Brief delivery delays are posted there when they occur.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sec-section">
          <h2 class="sec-heading">Security disclosures</h2>
          <p>
            Report suspected security vulnerabilities to
            <a href="mailto:security@nodalpulse.com">security@nodalpulse.com</a>.
            Please allow reasonable time to investigate before public disclosure.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .help-links {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .help-links a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--np-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .help-links a:hover {
    color: var(--np-accent-hover);
  }
</style>
